From: SHiP <noreply@ship.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Include <cstdio> instead of ROOT's snprintf.h

ROOT 6.42 no longer ships the snprintf.h compatibility header, so
TPythia6.cxx fails with "snprintf.h: No such file or directory".
snprintf is standard C++ via <cstdio>, which works with older ROOT too.
---
--- a/src/TPythia6.cxx
+++ b/src/TPythia6.cxx
@@ -67,7 +67,7 @@
 #include "TClonesArray.h"
 #include "TMCParticle.h"
 #include "TParticle.h"
-#include "snprintf.h"
+#include <cstdio>
 #include "strlcpy.h"
 
 TPythia6*  TPythia6::fgInstance = nullptr;
